From 8c34f4fcde47a30db7f71da1709cd7ac3abe50ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sandbox user <tools@notanumber.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 16:01:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] =?UTF-8?q?refactor(webapp):=20write-ownership=20lock-?=
 =?UTF-8?q?down=20=E2=80=94=20alts=20owns=20alteration=20tickets?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Admin can no longer create or mutate alteration tickets:

- /intake/alterations, /orders/alterations, /orders/alterations/:t,
  /orders/alterations/:t/{tags,receipt}, /admin/board now permanently
  redirect to the alts equivalents via new AltsRedirect page
  (same pattern as AltsGarmentRedirect / HER-55)
- Deleted dead write surfaces: IntakeAlterations, TicketDetail,
  OrdersAlterations, AdminBoard, AlterationTags, AlterationReceipt,
  SaveCartControls, EditTicketDrawer, CompleteGarmentModal,
  AlterationDailyBrief, AlterationsBoard, AlterationKpiBar,
  TransferButton
- queries.ts: useCreateAlteration removed; read hooks kept
- New lib/altsLinks.ts centralizes alts deep-link URLs
  (VITE_ALTS_PUBLIC_URL, falls back to https://alts.lstailors.com)

Read-only widgets kept: dashboard KPIs, TransferModal (stock transfers,
not tickets), customer views. apps/alts untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
