From 8ea8f47987d5d9f60edb5faaa72f47fa19057c3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sandbox user <tools@notanumber.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 15:54:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] =?UTF-8?q?refactor(webapp):=20deliveries=20single-wri?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ter=20=E2=80=94=20alts=20owns=20all=20delivery=20writes?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Admin (webapp) can no longer POST/PATCH LSH Delivery. Every mutation
surface is removed or redirected to alts via lib/altsLinks.ts:

- Deliveries board: read-only; New Delivery / Schedule / Start /
  Mark delivered replaced with Manage-in-Alts deep-links; driver
  stop-list (DriverRoute) retired in favor of the alts route
- DeliveryDetail: read-only; status/cancel/contact-swap/POD removed,
  Manage-in-Alts CTA added; AI insights + proof viewer kept (GET only)
- intake/TicketDetail + orders/CustomOrderDetail: from-order create
  and hand-deliver flows replaced with alts deep-links
- DeliveryLabel: log-label-print POST dropped (alts logs prints)
- queries.ts: useUpdateDelivery / useCreateDelivery / useMarkDelivered /
  useDeliveryGenerateMessage / useDeliverySearchContext deleted
- Deleted DriverRoute, NewDeliveryDialog, MarkDeliveredDialog,
  GenerateMessageDialog components

apps/alts and shared backend/API untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../src/components/deliveries/DriverRoute.tsx | 501 ------------------
 .../deliveries/GenerateMessageDialog.tsx      | 147 -----
 .../deliveries/MarkDeliveredDialog.tsx        | 355 -------------
 .../deliveries/NewDeliveryDialog.tsx          | 353 ------------
 webapp/src/lib/queries.ts                     |  97 +---
 webapp/src/pages/Deliveries.tsx               | 114 ++--
 webapp/src/pages/DeliveryDetail.tsx           | 214 +-------
 webapp/src/pages/DeliveryLabel.tsx            |  12 +-
 webapp/src/pages/orders/CustomOrderDetail.tsx |  36 +-
 9 files changed, 72 insertions(+), 1757 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 webapp/src/components/deliveries/DriverRoute.tsx
 delete mode 100644 webapp/src/components/deliveries/GenerateMessageDialog.tsx
 delete mode 100644 webapp/src/components/deliveries/MarkDeliveredDialog.tsx
 delete mode 100644 webapp/src/components/deliveries/NewDeliveryDialog.tsx

